Exceptions:

- patches/ and toolchain/ext-hdmi/ modify or build parts of the Linux kernel
  and are licensed under GPL-2.0, like the kernel they apply to. The kernel
  modules built from them are GPL-2.0.
- compat/mt-touchscreen.patch is a patch to libudev-zero and is offered under
  libudev-zero's ISC license.
- bridge/kbridge links FBInk statically. FBInk is GPL-3.0, so a distributed
  kbridge binary is GPL-3.0. FBInk, libudev-zero and the kernel source are
  fetched at build time and are not part of this repository.
